    "code": "CONFOUNDING",
    "text": "Winning is influenced by numerous factors (team quality, opponent, player performance, other strategic choices). Isolating the effect of 'adhering to a suppression-conditional recommended mix' would require robust controls, which are challenging with a small sample size."
   }
  ]
 },
