 },
 "risks": [
  {
   "code": "MEASURE_RELIABILITY",
   "text": "The core independent variable, 'adhering to a suppression-conditional recommended mix,' lacks a clear definition. How 'suppression' is identified, what constitutes the 'recommended mix,' and how 'adherence' is measured from play-by-play data are critical and undefined challenges. Without these definitions, the variable cannot be reliably constructed."
  },
